            "observable": "Uses R = ρL / A, or equivalently R ∝ 1 / A for wires of the same material and length."
          },
          {
            "criterion_id": "9702_s19_23_q06_b_ii_mp02",
            "observable": "Calculates the area ratio X / Y as R_Y / R_X = 2.0 / 8.0 = 0.25."
          }
        ]
      }
