            "observable": "Uses I ∝ Av, or forms I_X / I_Y = A_Xv_X / (A_Yv_Y)."
          },
          {
            "criterion_id": "9702_s19_23_q06_b_ii_mp04",
            "observable": "Uses (0.60 / 1.8)(1 / 0.25) to obtain a drift-speed ratio X / Y of 1.3."
